speaker.md
## Absorption data
That's what we see. It is published data, 3 modes:
1. chiral phonon, so it will react to magnetic field
2,3 magneto-polarons

It is important: the eigenstates of light are linearly polarized.
We need to apply magnetic field to see something interesting.

