speaker.md
## Summary
There are still open questions:

- role of hybridization
- in principle the framework we used does only need matrix elements p and m, we can assume that the phonon wavefunction is there as well and it gives a nice boost to the effect.
- how to use or should we use spin-group analysis for that;
- the same effect found in CMO, which is again an altermagnet candidate and also shows large Faraday rotation.

